ukuro. Kami pergi sorak Daru di sana, rupanya.", 94], [null, "在池袋的一家玩具店，舉辦過一次雷網‧連線對戰卡的小型比賽，我和真由里是陪達魯去的。", 41], [null, "在池袋的一家玩具店里，举办过一次雷NET联线战士的小型比赛，我和真由理是陪桶子去的。", 42]], null, 192, {"data": [["bgm", "bgm", {"name": "bgm", "replay": {"filename": "bgm09", "loop": 1, "start": null, "state": 1, "volume": 80.0}, "update": {"state": 1}}], ["subwin", "subwin_info", {"action": [["originz", -500], ["$progress", -1]], "class": "subwin_info", "name": "subwin", "redraw": {"disp": 2, "imageFile": {"file": "subwindow.mtn", "options": {"chara": "SUBWIN", "motion": "progress", "speed": 1.0, "tickcount": 0.0, "variables": {"progress": -1.0}}}, "posName": null}, "showmode": 3, "type": null}], ["bg", "stage", {"action": [["zpos", 233.33333333333337]], "class": "stage", "name": "bg", "redraw": {"disp": 2, "imageFile": {"file": "resg_bg049a1_mob", "options": {"resolution": 150}}, "posName": null}, "showmode": 3, "type": null}]], "env": {"action": [["cameray", 100], ["camerazoom", 110], ["camerax", 400]], "name": "env"}, "msgwin": 0}], [null, [[null, "だが、ダルが腹痛でリタイアし、急遽俺とまゆりが飛び入り参戦することになったのだ。", 40], [null, "Tapi dia dropout karena sakit perut, jadi Mayuri dan aku ambil tempatnya.", 73], [null, "但達魯因為肚子痛退賽，臨時由我和真由里上場。", 22], [null, "但桶子因为肚子痛退赛，临时由我和真由理上场。", 22]], null, 192, {"data": [["bgm", "bgm", {"name": "bgm", "replay": {"filename": "bgm09", "loop": 1, "start": null, "state": 1, "volume": 80.0}, "update": {"state": 1}}], ["subwin", "subwin_info", {"action": [["originz", -500], ["$progress", -1]], "class": "subwin_info", "name": "subwin", "redraw": {"disp": 2, "imageFile": {"file": "subwindow.mtn", "options": {"chara": "SUBWIN", "motion": "progress", "speed": 1.0, "tickcount": 0.0, "variables": {"progress": -1.0}}}, "posName": null}, "showmode": 3, "type": null}], ["bg", "stage", {"action": [["zpos", 233.33333333333337]], "class": "stage", "name": "bg", "redraw": {"disp": 2, "imageFile": {"file": "resg_bg049a1_mob", "options": {"resolution": 150}}, "posName": null}, "showmode": 3, "type